{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Asa\u2019s Adventure&quot; is a puzzle game rendered in a hand-drawn art style.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/1f6f15af25d27e95c2bd906aef1ef9e2.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day after the sudden disappearance of human civilization, the protagonist Asa awakens in an abandoned cave within an underground world. He has no memory of his age, where he is, or why he came to be there\u2014even his body seems to have shrunk. Surrounding him are derelict factories, caves, pipes, and structures from bygone eras. In his hand rests a compass that appears to guide him toward some unknown destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.poster.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1170 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.webm?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.mp4?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He navigates through winding tunnels and arrives at an underground urban square, a place devoid of human traces yet teeming with creatures like moles. To progress, he must collect three chestnuts to give to the guard stationed at the entrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/3fd8543f0ca0940fb623f40352d21166.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there others besides Asa in this world? What do these strange inscriptions mean? Where does the compass lead, and are there people there? With these questions lingering, players will follow Asa\u2019s perspective to explore and unravel the mysteries of this post-apocalyptic realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/c2b7efc26eb1656ab50fab1bed529d92.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though set in a desolate wasteland, &quot;Asa\u2019s Adventure&quot; is far from hopeless. The game eschews gory content, instead immersing players in a graffiti-inspired hand-drawn world as they uncover its forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/fee7b0db05d526a504e9309856d93a3e.poster.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/fee7b0db05d526a504e9309856d93a3e.webm?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters and environments are hand-drawn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, bite-sized puzzle minigames with balanced difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars to unlock in-game guides, plus hidden Easter eggs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original in-game text that, once the &quot;Rosetta Stone&quot; is found, aids in quick puzzle-solving (Note: This feature may ultimately not be implemented, as developing it alone presents significant challenges at present).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just to note, My English level is quite average, and the part above was translated using AI. If there are any awkwardness or inaccuracies in the expression, please feel free to point them out\u2014I\u2019d appreciate it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032860?t=1761396203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/3341102853443601133769c9f6fbe9f0266ae1f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761396203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/64fb8592e053f05b68e89a9c7f266e8ea8d4f160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761396203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/64fb8592e053f05b68e89a9c7f266e8ea8d4f160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761396203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Asa\u2019s Adventure&quot; is a puzzle game rendered in a hand-drawn art style.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/1f6f15af25d27e95c2bd906aef1ef9e2.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day after the sudden disappearance of human civilization, the protagonist Asa awakens in an abandoned cave within an underground world. He has no memory of his age, where he is, or why he came to be there\u2014even his body seems to have shrunk. Surrounding him are derelict factories, caves, pipes, and structures from bygone eras. In his hand rests a compass that appears to guide him toward some unknown destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.poster.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1170 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.webm?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/cb3bf9343dec1522e66c2f6177d84bdf.mp4?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He navigates through winding tunnels and arrives at an underground urban square, a place devoid of human traces yet teeming with creatures like moles. To progress, he must collect three chestnuts to give to the guard stationed at the entrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/3fd8543f0ca0940fb623f40352d21166.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there others besides Asa in this world? What do these strange inscriptions mean? Where does the compass lead, and are there people there? With these questions lingering, players will follow Asa\u2019s perspective to explore and unravel the mysteries of this post-apocalyptic realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/c2b7efc26eb1656ab50fab1bed529d92.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though set in a desolate wasteland, &quot;Asa\u2019s Adventure&quot; is far from hopeless. The game eschews gory content, instead immersing players in a graffiti-inspired hand-drawn world as they uncover its forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/fee7b0db05d526a504e9309856d93a3e.poster.avif?t=1761396203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/fee7b0db05d526a504e9309856d93a3e.webm?t=1761396203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters and environments are hand-drawn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, bite-sized puzzle minigames with balanced difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars to unlock in-game guides, plus hidden Easter eggs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original in-game text that, once the &quot;Rosetta Stone&quot; is found, aids in quick puzzle-solving (Note: This feature may ultimately not be implemented, as developing it alone presents significant challenges at present).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just to note, My English level is quite average, and the part above was translated using AI. If there are any awkwardness or inaccuracies in the expression, please feel free to point them out\u2014I\u2019d appreciate it.</p>","developers":["xiaoshi"],"genres":[{"description":"Advent